{"id":"vod_bf_39132","vodId":"39132","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"希德尼娅的骑士","name_cn":"希德尼娅的骑士","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-40/bafc9286910adf2c6c6d6f2b71ba97e7.jpg"},"summary":"曾几何时，神秘生物奇居子入侵太阳系，致使人类流离失所，只能乘坐行星般大小的巨型飞船希德尼娅流浪在茫茫宇宙中。如是过了漫长的一千年，而今希德尼娅的居民们已有一百年未曾遭遇奇居子，不过他们从未放松警惕，培养了一代又一代操纵人形兵器“卫人”的驾驶员。某天，居住在地下的青年谷风长道（逢坂良太 配音）迫于饥饿爬到地面，偷米后被人抓住，后在舰长（大原沙耶香 配音）的授意下成为卫人驾驶员第628期的训练生，在这里他见到了有过一面之缘的善良女孩星白闲（洲崎绫 配音）、友好的第三性人科户濑伊扎那（丰崎爱生 配音）以及高傲刚愎的岐神海苔夫（樱井孝宏 配音）等人。未几，少年们外出执行采集任务，甚至却遭逢百年不见的奇居子。沉寂已久的宇宙战争再度拉开帷幕……　　本片根据贰瓶勉的漫画原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:55:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"CUT","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/CUT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xideniyadeqishi/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshot